## Milestone Rules

Based on the scene design report and CommonSense feedback, here are the milestone rules. I'm designing these to work with the scene as-built, noting that the "light up a tower" task can be completed with redstone torches (which the player already has), making it independent of the button crafting task.

```json
{
  "milestones": [
    {
      "id": "find_dark_oak_leaves",
      "description": "Player finds the dark oak leaves crown on top of the tower",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "position_inside_box",
          "params": {
            "x_min": 3,
            "x_max": 13,
            "y_min": 0,
            "y_max": 12,
            "z_min": 3,
            "z_max": 13
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "voxel_count_in_box",
          "params": {
            "block_type": "dark_oak_leaves",
            "x_min": 6,
            "x_max": 10,
            "y_min": 9,
            "y_max": 10,
            "z_min": 6,
            "z_max": 10
          },
          "expected_count_min": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "find_powered_rail",
      "description": "Player finds the powered rail on the rail line",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "position_inside_box",
          "params": {
            "x_min": -10,
            "x_max": -2,
            "y_min": 0,
            "y_max": 3,
            "z_min": -5,
